  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math>.</p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>c